etros\nLavabo\nAmplas salas integradas\nEspaço gourmet com churrasqueira, fogão a lenha e forno de pizza\nPiscina aquecida\nJardim e depósito\nGaragem para até 4 carros\nRua tranquila e excelente localização\n\nOs móveis soltos e eletrodomésticos poderão ser negociados à parte. \n\nProprietário estuda receber imóvel de até 50% do valor como parte de pagamento.\n\nUma oportunidade única para quem busca conforto, lazer e a exclusividade de morar em Santa Felicidade.\n\nParcerias são bem vindas!!","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a258c33e72e598d06b6e7df/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f441e1e9-ada8-4b64-9695-256d4ae1d07a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a258c33e72e598d06b6e7df/pilar-homes-images-watermark/457c5425-120d-44e2-9847-e2b09356c5ef.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a258c33e72e598d06b6e7df/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e32ff881-0658-48da-bafe-568764c3e8d2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a258c33e72e598d06b6e7df/pilar-homes-images-watermark/35b4d95e-f479-47f4-ac28-73098d84bf04.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a258c33e72e598d06b6e7df/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0160536d-16d1-4972-83ea-9aabd4de511c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a258c33e72e598d06b6e7df/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2dbedaab-51b4-4978-8f70-7a38263ee78e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a258c33e72e598d06b6e7df/pilar-homes-images-watermark/690341e8-e2fa-437f-8b17-d512e4628b94.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a258c33e72e598d06b6e7df/pilar-homes-images-watermark/17ccd055-d091-40fb-af64-3438cb8cb19e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a258c33e72e598d06b6e7df/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c914f8aa-bb29-4c5b-8bb6-55bceb9ec90c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a258c33e72e598d06b6e7df/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4ec7c381-246f-4850-8752-a2c468a1bf56.jpeg","